209
00:15:08.880 --> 00:15:10.120
I haven't been around.

210
00:15:10.280 --> 00:15:11.406
Where'd you find him?

211
00:15:12.200 --> 00:15:13.326
He found me.

212
00:15:14.120 --> 00:15:15.326
You following her?

213
00:15:16.680 --> 00:15:19.001
No, no. Just saw
her in the park.

214
00:15:23.760 --> 00:15:26.650
